{
  "description": "std-doc-page — one page of a documentation site: a section sidebar with the current page marked, a breadcrumb, the page title and lede, an \"on this page\" contents list, the page's own content (a render slot the call site fills, live behaviors included) and previous/next links. Supports right-to-left pages. Pick for docs sites, handbooks, reference manuals and knowledge bases.",
